    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277984</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おやっ、見かけない顔だね。
あんたもこの村に住みたい
希望者かい？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh my, I've never seen your faces
around here. Were you hoping to
move to this village, too?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278092</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おや、そちらにいるのは
&lt;Cless&gt;ちゃんじゃないの。
お知り合い？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh my, but that's &lt;Cless&gt;
you have beside you. Do
you all know each other?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278140</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ、はい……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah, yes...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278244</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Mint&gt;さんがいるのにダメよ、
火遊びはほどほどにしないと</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You already have &lt;Mint&gt;, don't you?
You should try to keep from
fooling around too much.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278308</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ、いえ、
そういうのでは……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah, no, I haven't been...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278388</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ヒドイ！　&lt;Cless&gt;、
私のこと、遊びだったの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wow, &lt;Cless&gt;! So that's all we were?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278440</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Rody&gt;まで……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Not you, too, &lt;Rody&gt;...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278508</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>希望者って
わけじゃないけど……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, we aren't planning
to move here, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278612</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この村は、
１年半前のあの惨劇から、
立ち直ろうとしているの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ever since the tragedy
a year and a half ago,
we've been rebuilding.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278676</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ね？　&lt;Cless&gt;ちゃん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Right, &lt;Cless&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278728</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ、ええ、まあ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, yes, we have...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278968</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>避難して生き残った人と、
新しく移り住んできた人で
協力して村を再建したのよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Those who evacuated and survived,
along with new people just moving
in, have worked together to build this.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278968</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私はこの村長いけど、
新しい人は入ってくるななんて、
言うつもりは毛頭ないわ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I've been here a very long time,
but I wouldn't dream of chasing
off anyone who wants to join us.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278968</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ちゃんと村のルールを
守ってくれさえすればね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, so long as they can
follow our rules, at least.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279040</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>んじゃあ、
オレたちもここに住もっか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, then, how about
we live here, too?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279120</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……きみ、そんなに
&lt;Red&gt;エトスハウス&lt;White&gt;がいや？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Do you really hate
&lt;Red&gt;My House&lt;White&gt; that much?</EnglishText>
      <Notes>doesn't make sense for ethos to use the name of her house in third person, so changing it like the other one. -dragon</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Problematic</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279180</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そういうことと
違くって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Nah, that's not it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279396</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>やっぱり住むなら、
穏やかな環境よね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If you're trying to pick somewhere
to live, the quiet countryside's the
best, you know.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279396</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この村はあの惨劇を除けば、
ずっと平和そのものよね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Except for that tragedy, this village
has always been at peace.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279396</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この村であった事件って言えば、
２００年ほど前にあったらしい
誘拐事件くらいかしらね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The only incident I can think of's
that one kidnapping I've heard
happened about 200 years ago. </EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279452</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>２００年前の誘拐事件？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There was a kidnapping
200 years ago?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279620</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あら？　&lt;Cless&gt;ちゃん、
知らないの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh? You didn't know
about that, &lt;Cless&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279672</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>誘拐事件、ですか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What kidnapping?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279848</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>怪しい連中が
ちっちゃい女の子連れて、
この村に来たの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Some very suspicious men
brought a small girl into
the village with them.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279848</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>３歳くらいの子だった
らしいんだけど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>From what I've heard, she
was about 3 years old.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279848</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どうやら、どこかで
さらってきたらしくて</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It seemed like they'd kidnapped
her somehow, from somewhere.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279892</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>へぇ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huh...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279976</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>確か、&lt;Rody&gt;って
名前の子だったわね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If I recall, her
name was &lt;Rody&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280088</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>え？　私……？
いやぁ、偶然だって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh? Me...? ...No, just
a coincidence, I guess.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280088</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>同じ呼び方の子なんて
いくらでもいるっしょ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There are a lot of kids who
use that nickname, right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280152</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そう、かなぁ……
そうかも……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Um, I wonder...
Well, maybe...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280224</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>んで、その子どもは
どうなったんだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And so, what happened
to that girl?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280396</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ちゃんと救出されたわよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Someone rescued her.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280396</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、その前にその誘拐犯
ってのが、宿屋に立てこもって
大変だったんだって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But before that, her captors holed
themselves up in the village inn.
It was a big problem at the time...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280396</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>村の連中は
誰も手を出せなくて</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No one in the village wanted
to be involved with them.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280456</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、助かったんですよね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But she was saved, right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280568</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうなのよね。結局、
事件の顛末については
どこにも残ってないのよね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Right. But after all that,
no one really talked
about the particulars.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280640</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この村で、そんなことが
あったんですね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So something like that
happened right here, huh.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280840</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうなのよ～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's right~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280840</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そんな誘拐事件が２００年後の
今に語り継がれちゃうくらい、
平和な村よ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And people still talk about that single
kidnapping from 200 years back.
That's how peaceful our village is.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280840</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そのうえ、今は&lt;Cless&gt;ちゃんが
ちゃんとこの村を守って
くれてるから安心よ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And on top of that, we have
&lt;Cless&gt; to protect the village now,
so there's nothing to worry about!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280928</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>こんなのどかな村で、
昔、そんなことが
あったんですね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So, a long time ago, something
like that happened in a quiet
little village like this...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281124</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうなのよ～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's right~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281124</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そんな誘拐事件が２００年後の
今に語り継がれちゃうくらい、
平和な村よ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And people still talk about that single
kidnapping from 200 years back.
That's how peaceful our village is.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281124</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そのうえ、今は&lt;Cless&gt;ちゃんも
いるし、遊撃隊ってのもある
から、安心ね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And on top of that, we have
&lt;Cless&gt; to protect the village now,
so there's nothing to worry about!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281180</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Cless&gt;さん、大活躍だな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You're doing a
great job, &lt;Cless&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281264</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……やっぱり、&lt;Rody&gt;って
私のことなのかな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Maybe that &lt;Rody&gt;
was me, actually...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>47</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281312</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Rody&gt;さん？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Rody&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>48</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281444</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私、何も覚えてないけど……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I don't really remember it...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>49</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281444</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>すごくいい村なのに、
ここ来た時、嫌な感じに胸が
どきどきしちゃってさ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But it's such a nice village...and I always get
this horrible feeling in my chest when I come
here, and then my heart starts racing.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>49</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281520</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もしかして、
その事件の時の思い出が……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Maybe it's because part
of you remembers it...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>51</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281572</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>かもしれないね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, might be...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
